      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 5
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f45c87f50355e3a4e933dfae013f360b, type: 3}
    _line: Ben's gaze yet again pierces through you. It's as though he knows exactly
      what you're thinking right now.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 0
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 5
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 57219506f5822de43b8c7a9d4e6b1e3d, type: 3}
    _line: Like I said earlier, the only thing I really needed was your cooperation.
      And you were kind enough to give that to me already.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 5
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b949ebd089be19a4e8da79030c7a5172, type: 3}
    _line: Thanks for indulging my little game. I guess you could call it one last
      bit of fishing between friends.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 5
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f45c87f50355e3a4e933dfae013f360b, type: 3}
    _line: But I'm really quite alright. Nothing wrong with me at all, see?
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 5
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f45c87f50355e3a4e933dfae013f360b, type: 3}
    _line: You stare at Ben blankly. Blinking your eyes, his appearance seems to
      revert back to normal for a moment.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 0
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 4
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f45c87f50355e3a4e933dfae013f360b, type: 3}
    _line: All that is to say... well, goodbye. I truly enjoyed the time we spent
      together. Although I doubt we'll ever see each other again, it was fun while
      it lasted.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 9
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80cf6c42690270f4cb33f622149f455f, type: 3}
    _line: Ben's gaze softens for a moment as he looks at you one last time. Then,
      he turns toward the pool and jumps in, arms at his sides.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 0
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 9
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52718351f1297a647a7bffcb0c4a4b0f, type: 3}
    _line: Ben? Ben!
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 1
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 9
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52718351f1297a647a7bffcb0c4a4b0f, type: 3}
    _line: You rush to the water's edge and peer in, but Ben is nowhere to be seen.
      It's as if he was never there at all.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 0
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 9
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 1
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a877b818a040d48cfad7800ec1022fdd, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52718351f1297a647a7bffcb0c4a4b0f, type: 3}
    _line: Befuddled, and more than a little unnerved, you manage to compose yourself
      enough to drive home.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 0
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 9
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a877b818a040d48cfad7800ec1022fdd, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52718351f1297a647a7bffcb0c4a4b0f, type: 3}
    _line: It's going to be hard to deal with the leftover feelings you had for Ben.
      Given time, you're sure you'll recover, but it's certain to take time, and
      plenty of it.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 0
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 9
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a877b818a040d48cfad7800ec1022fdd, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52718351f1297a647a7bffcb0c4a4b0f, type: 3}
    _line: But Ben wouldn't want you to be sad. That's not the kind of person he
      is, or was.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 0
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 9
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 1
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 84bce586771c7480dae76c4532954736, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52718351f1297a647a7bffcb0c4a4b0f, type: 3}
    _line: As you get ready for bed after such an arduous day, the aquarium in your
      room catches the corner of your eye.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 0
      _name: 
      _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
    _characterSpriteSettings:
    - _spriteIndex: 0
      IsSubject:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 1
      IsRevealed:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      HasArrived:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: 0
      StartingAnchorPosition:
        _isEnabled: 0
        _value: {x: 0, y: 0}
      StartingDimensions:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value: {x: 750, y: 900}
      ImageSearchParameters:
        _isEnabled: 1
        _value:
          _profile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cef2e72371f654a43b43317c22347f40, type: 2}
          _imageType: 9
          _version: 1
  - _newBackground:
      _isEnabled: 0
      _value: {fileID: 0}
    hasBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 84bce586771c7480dae76c4532954736, type: 3}
    hasSFX: 0
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52718351f1297a647a7bffcb0c4a4b0f, type: 3}
    _line: You had bought it partway into the class, having been inspired by a lesson
      on underwater ecosystems.
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 0
      _name: 
